# Overlapping obligations and several antecedent endpoints (docs/strategies.md).

== strategies_example_3
# The obligation from 0 dies at 2 although the one from 1 is alive in the same position.
property: a |-> ##[1:2] b ##1 c
clause: 16.7 16.12.7
class: normative
sample : 0 1 2 3 4
a      : 1 1 . . .
b      : . 1 . 1 .
c      : . . . . 1
fail   : . . 1 . .
pass   : . . . . 1

== several_antecedent_endpoints_from_one_start
property: a ##[1:2] b |-> c
clause: 16.7 16.12.7
class: normative
sample : 0 1 2 3
a      : 1 . . .
b      : . 1 1 .
c      : . 1 . .
fail   : . . 1 .
pass   : . 1 . .
